To meet the client's requirements, we will use a hybrid retrieval approach (lexical + semantic) to retrieve relevant information from the client's corpus and generate high-quality drafts. Our RAG technology will enable us to provide explainable and transparent outputs, with source citations and retrieved passages, ensuring that the generated content is trustworthy and reliable.

Overall, our proposed AI strategy combines the strengths of RAG, structured extraction, and template-guided drafting to provide a comprehensive solution for clinical and administrative content generation, medical coding support, and dossier context awareness.
